4.2  You represent that You hold the rights necessary for that grant, including
     any employer/client authorization, and disclose relevant third-party terms.
     Contributions may be rejected. Submission does not entitle You to payment,
     commercial rights, support, or acceptance of the proposed change.

4.3  You may send patches privately to the Copyright Holder or through the
     official repository's contribution workflow. A minimal contribution fork
     required by that workflow is permitted solely to submit the change, with
